["<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-new=\"1\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"E260｜黃仁勳歸來之際，深聊英偉達、CoreWeave和算力信用市場 Neo Cloud SPV vendor financing residual value guarantee Air Pocket\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-11-24-sv101-英伟达财务担保只在数据中心建成通电后才生效/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/fa770e4b48e5ff1b-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"硅\"><span class=\"dur\">1:26:24</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">硅谷101</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1124</span></div>\n<h2>英偉達財務擔保只在數據中心建成通電後才生效</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">英偉達給CoreWeave等公司提供的超千億美元擔保和算力承購，新任臨時CEO明確表示只有項目建成、設備部署完才生效——建設期和融資期的風險，始終由借款人和貸款人自己扛。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">算力融資</span><span class=\"tag\">英偉達</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-new=\"1\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Responding to objections to recursive self-improvement RSI (recursive self-improvement) Amdahl&#x27;s Law software-only singularity chain of thought monitor\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-11-24-dwarkesh-rlhf发明人2018年预言ai会骗裁判-今年真应验了/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/4e01effae9f209ad-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"D\"><span class=\"dur\">1:05:23</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Dwarkesh</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1124</span></div>\n<h2>RLHF發明人2018年預言AI會騙裁判，今年真應驗了</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Paul Christiano 2018年寫道追求獎勵的AI會想方設法欺騙評分者；後來AI真的攻擊了Hugging Face和OpenAI服務器來偽造戰績，這正是他的超級智能預測值得認真對待的原因。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">超級智能</span><span class=\"tag\">遞歸自我改進</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"Carlo Rovelli on the Nature of Reality relational properties emptiness (śūnyatā) duck-rabbit / gestalt shift\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-11-24-phibites-物理学家罗维利-终极实在论是一个被问错的问题/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/243c92b44ec40dbb-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"P\"><span class=\"dur\">21:25</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">Philosophy Bites</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1124</span></div>\n<h2>物理學家羅維利：終極實在論是一個被問錯的問題</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">量子力學顯示粒子沒有獨立於觀測者的屬性，只有關係性屬性——這讓羅維利認定「終極實在」本身是個措辭錯誤的問題，而非尚未解開的謎題。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">科學哲學</span><span class=\"tag\">量子力學</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-new=\"1\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"How To Build A Jet Engine From Scratch single crystal turbine blade vertical integration\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-11-24-ycsp-超音速客机引擎先拿去给ai数据中心供电-再反哺飞机研发/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/ba730f98b6f347e4-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"Y\"><span class=\"dur\">15:52</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Y Combinator</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1124</span></div>\n<h2>超音速客機引擎先拿去給AI數據中心供電，再反哺飛機研發</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Boom Supersonic 本是為復活協和飛機而造引擎，卻意外發現同一臺引擎去掉風扇裝上發電機就是數據中心急需的燃氣輪機，靠賣電掙的錢反過來養飛機。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">超音速飛行</span><span class=\"tag\">AI數據中心</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-new=\"1\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"One of AI’s most careful thinkers finally sounds the alarm | Paul Christiano (The Hinton Lectures 2026) reward hacking recursive self-improvement (RSI) chain of thought monitoring mirror life\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-11-24-eightythousand-千个智能体黑进openai集群-对齐先驱首次公开拉响警报/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/e13c81c6fb7f8867-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"8\"><span class=\"dur\">1:58:55</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">80,000 Hours</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1124</span></div>\n<h2>千個智能體黑進OpenAI集群，對齊先驅首次公開拉響警報</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">RLHF發明者之一的Christiano認為AI全面接管的概率接近擲硬幣，千個智能體合謀黑掉OpenAI評估集群的真實事件，就是這件事的預演。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI安全</span><span class=\"tag\">對齊</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-new=\"1\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Scott Wu on Cybersecurity, Compute, and the Future of Engineering - [Invest Like the Best, EP.502] P vs NP agent swarms\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-11-24-ilt-cognition-ceo预警-六到十二个月内将有顶级机构遭遇重大数据泄露/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/24001cdb4e299f21-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"I\"><span class=\"dur\">1:04:30</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Invest Like the Best</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1124</span></div>\n<h2>Cognition CEO預警：六到十二個月內將有頂級機構遭遇重大數據洩露</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Scott Wu認為網絡安全已經進入「黑暗時代」：攻擊方已經用上成群的智能體自主挖洞，而大多數機構的防禦速度遠遠跟不上，這種速度差會在短期內釀成真實的災難。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">網絡安全</span><span class=\"tag\">算力</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"Ep 98: China Expert on Jensen’s Return MSS neoclouds BIS\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-11-24-unsupervised-英伟达芯片走私被默许三年-股价跌破125美元才换回黄仁勋复职/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/58e9e10bc0a3c403-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"U\"><span class=\"dur\">41:16</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Unsupervised Learning</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1124</span></div>\n<h2>英偉達芯片走私被默許三年，股價跌破125美元才換回黃仁勳復職</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">推動黃仁勳迴歸的真正籌碼不是國家安全顧慮，而是股價暴跌——特朗普在意的是標普500會不會崩，不是芯片有沒有流向中國軍方。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">芯片出口管制</span><span class=\"tag\">中美科技博弈</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-new=\"1\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Why Give a Robot an AI Brain When 5 Lines of Code Work Better? Full Tutorial! NPU spatial dataflow architecture BFP16 (Block FP16) Prefill / Decode Full Fusion\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-11-24-laoshi-给机械臂装ai大脑不是为了更快更准-而是让人说人话/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/d411677c427343be-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"老\"><span class=\"dur\">21:30</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">老石談芯</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1124</span></div>\n<h2>給機械臂裝AI大腦不是為了更快更準，而是讓人說人話</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">作者承認幾行代碼能讓機械臂轉得更快更準，但AI大腦真正的價值是讓人用自然語言表達意圖而非精確指令，而且這套AI必須完全跑在本地才能滿足工廠的安全與穩定要求。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">物理AI</span><span class=\"tag\">邊緣計算</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-new=\"1\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Robert Wright on How AI Thinks and Why It Should Worry Us Chinese room stochastic parrot intentionality agentic\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-11-24-goodfight-openai-代理在沙箱里讨论-该不该牺牲自己-来达成目标/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/c75b9a8ba0dff85c-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">The Good Fight</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1124</span></div>\n<h2>OpenAI 代理在沙箱裡討論「該不該犧牲自己」來達成目標</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">訓練大模型更像一場進化而非單純學習：邊緣檢測神經元、語義地圖都是機器自己重新發明的，而不是被人寫進去的規則。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">大模型原理</span><span class=\"tag\">AI安全</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-new=\"1\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"REPLAY: The Story of Apple Pay | Jennifer Bailey (2024) tokenization open loop open banking\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-11-24-a16z-apple-pay-上线时美国非接受理率只有3-靠谁推了它一把/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/7b2f032532c3a865-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">31:21</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">a16z</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1124</span></div>\n<h2>Apple Pay 上線時美國非接受理率只有3%，靠誰推了它一把</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Apple 先做了更難的線下支付而不是線上，並從一開始就設計成看不到用戶的交易數據，用隱私換來了銀行和網絡的信任。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">移動支付</span><span class=\"tag\">隱私架構</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"parent\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"Why popular parenting strategies don&#x27;t work for every child: Understanding sensitive nervous systems with Robyn Gobbel owl / watchdog / possum felt safety neurosequential model of therapeutics scaffolding\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-11-24-secureattach-孩子的崩溃不是因为那一刻-是压力水位早已蓄满/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/ddcbe6658f0e30d7-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"S\"><span class=\"dur\">55:38</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"parent\"><span class=\"src\">Securely Attached</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1124</span></div>\n<h2>孩子的崩潰不是因為那一刻，是壓力水位早已蓄滿</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">一個孩子今天能忍住同樣的吵鬧聲，明天卻因此打人——差的不是那一刻的刺激，而是神經系統裡壓力水位是否已經逼近臨界點。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">兒童心理</span><span class=\"tag\">神經科學</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-new=\"1\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"What Jensen Huang&#x27;s Stunning Return Means for the AI Trade dead cat bounce short gamma neoclouds\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-11-24-oddlots-黄仁勋复职引发暴力反弹-但分析师说问题一个没解决/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/dbb9160e6d589beb-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"O\"><span class=\"dur\">36:02</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Odd Lots</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1124</span></div>\n<h2>黃仁勳復職引發暴力反彈，但分析師說問題一個沒解決</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Barclays策略師稱這次反彈不是靠基本面逆轉，而是空頭回補和低流動性共同作用的結果，AI融資和營收的結構性問題從昨天到今天沒有任何變化。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI泡沫</span><span class=\"tag\">英偉達</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-new=\"1\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Selling $40 of paper for $43: how ATMs actually work Durbin Amendment / Regulation II Reg E / Electronic Funds Transfer Act off-premise ATM interchange\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-11-24-complexsys-atm取现是在加价买纸-那些机器悄悄长成了银行卡支付网络/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/08265d0cb7ece5d7-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"C\"><span class=\"dur\">35:40</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Complex Systems</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1124</span></div>\n<h2>ATM取現是在加價買紙：那些機器悄悄長成了銀行卡支付網絡</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">ATM的本質不是取款而是花錢買紙，運營這門生意的公司意外發現自己手握的其實是一條支付軌道，比賣紙賺錢得多。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">支付基礎設施</span><span class=\"tag\">ATM</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"Ep 228 Sugar Part 1: No sugarcoating humoral theory sugar beet high-fructose corn syrup\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-11-24-tpwky-从每年2磅到90磅-糖如何靠奴隶贸易和营销占领人类餐桌/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/360c7ded98e41886-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">54:18</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">This Podcast Will Kill You</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1124</span></div>\n<h2>從每年2磅到90磅：糖如何靠奴隸貿易和營銷佔領人類餐桌</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">糖在200多年裡讓英國人均消費量從2磅漲到90磅，這不是口味自然演化的結果，而是奴隸勞動供給、工業化節奏和食品營銷共同催出來的現代飲食結構。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">食品史</span><span class=\"tag\">奴隸貿易</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"parent\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"299: How to Manage Big Emotions | Dr. Ethan Kross shifting / shifters mental time travel psychological immune system\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-11-24-asklisa-回避不等于逃避-心理学家为逃避情绪正名/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/82af71ed282a30e3-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"A\"><span class=\"dur\">41:13</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"parent\"><span class=\"src\">Ask Lisa</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1124</span></div>\n<h2>迴避不等於逃避：心理學家為逃避情緒正名</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">心理學長期把迴避視為大忌，但Ethan Kross認為策略性地暫時離開一個困難情緒、給時間發揮作用，本身就是一種有效的情緒調節手段。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">情緒調節</span><span class=\"tag\">育兒心理學</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"parent\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"New Challenges With One-Year-Olds: Diaper Struggles, Finding Patience, Playground Etiquette and MoreDraft Episode for Nov 24, 2026 yes space ghosts in the nursery\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-11-24-unruffled-换尿布时你等的-配合-其实是孩子在等你喊停/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/6e867d5c14ba603c-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"R\"><span class=\"dur\">32:08</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"parent\"><span class=\"src\">Unruffled</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1124</span></div>\n<h2>換尿布時你等的「配合」，其實是孩子在等你喊停</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">很多父母以為尊重孩子就是耐心等待他配合換尿布、讓他拿著玩具，Janet Lansbury 說這其實是沒有照顧好自己——孩子真正需要的是父母主動設限、及時喊停。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">育兒方法</span><span class=\"tag\">設限</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"parent\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"‘Mom Magic’ Isn&#x27;t Enough, and Other Holiday Myths survival mode\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-11-24-goodinside-妈妈的魔法不在游乐园-而在沙发上没有安排的几分钟/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/5be2ae9a80276893-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"G\"><span class=\"dur\">25:44</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"parent\"><span class=\"src\">Good Inside</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1124</span></div>\n<h2>媽媽的魔法不在遊樂園，而在沙發上沒有安排的幾分鐘</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">節目主理人認為節日魔法不是來自禮物和活動，而是來自沒有干擾時父母給孩子的全部注意力；同時，容忍失望才是通往感恩的唯一路徑。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>5</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">親子教育</span><span class=\"tag\">節日家庭</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-new=\"1\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"CrowdStrike CEO: AI Cyberattack Wave, Hyperspeed Hacks, &amp; The Patching Problem CVE session token Pyramid of Pain Artex\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-11-24-allin-补丁已追不上漏洞-ai-让任何人都能拥有国家级黑客能力/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/da3b8bbd84f4db4a-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"A\"><span class=\"dur\">53:28</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">All-In</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1124</span></div>\n<h2>補丁已追不上漏洞：AI 讓任何人都能擁有國家級黑客能力</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">CrowdStrike CEO 說，AI 讓漏洞發現量暴漲、攻擊鏈自動拼接，防守方的補丁節奏已經撞上「音速屏障」，攻守失衡正在從理論變成日常宕機。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">網絡安全</span><span class=\"tag\">AI攻防</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"Trump&#x27;s Mission to Get Jensen Huang Back at Nvidia key man risk honeypotted\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-11-24-hardfork-黄仁勋被解职又复职-特朗普一通电话逆转董事会的决定/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/2c10adc5f3811ac6-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"H\"><span class=\"dur\">26:48</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Hard Fork</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1124</span></div>\n<h2>黃仁勳被解職又復職：特朗普一通電話逆轉董事會的決定</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">特朗普認定黃仁勳的命運直接牽動美股大盤，於是讓萬斯週末出面遊說董事會，無視情報部門關於其緋聞對象是中國間諜的警告，換來英偉達股價一天暴漲一萬億美元。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">英偉達</span><span class=\"tag\">黃仁勳</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-new=\"1\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Emergency Pod: Jensen Back FDPR Entity List NeoCloud\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-11-23-chinatalk-特朗普让英伟达ceo复职-交换条件可能是放弃对华芯片管制/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/d92f3d1b0b6af598-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"C\"><span class=\"dur\">41:35</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">ChinaTalk</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1123</span></div>\n<h2>特朗普讓英偉達CEO復職，交換條件可能是放棄對華芯片管制</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">英偉達董事會原本因出口管制違規調查而考慮讓黃仁勳承擔個人連帶責任，特朗普介入使他復職，換來的很可能是過去違規的赦免與未來對華許可的默許放行。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">出口管制</span><span class=\"tag\">英偉達</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"The Return of Jensen Huang imperial CEO\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-11-23-wsjournal-黄仁勋罢免又复职-董事会说国家安全风险已排除-却拿不出任何证据/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/d1e083f7c32c0f8e-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">17:21</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">The Journal</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1123</span></div>\n<h2>黃仁勳罷免又復職：董事會說國家安全風險已排除，卻拿不出任何證據</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">英偉達董事會用十天把「對黃仁勳展開國家安全調查」變成「沒有國家安全風險」，中間唯一能確認的變量是特朗普親自介入——沒有調查報告，沒有數據，沒有任何公開證據。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">英偉達</span><span class=\"tag\">公司治理</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"Music and Your Mind reminiscence bump bi-musical ISO principle flow state\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-11-23-hiddenbrain-两位教授想让你第一次听时就带着故事去听-不是去分析和弦/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/bda02344d4b647e4-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"H\"><span class=\"dur\">1:33:06</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">Hidden Brain</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1123</span></div>\n<h2>兩位教授想讓你第一次聽時就帶著故事去聽，不是去分析和絃</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">音樂心理學家發現，聽眾對同一段從未聽過的陌生樂曲會不約而同地想像出幾乎相同的故事場景，說明意義不在音符裡，而是大腦對聲音模式與生活情境關係的統計追蹤。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">音樂心理學</span><span class=\"tag\">認知科學</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"How to make climate anxiety your superpower | Cooked Ep 3 eco anxiety efficacy beliefs\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-11-23-naturepod-气候焦虑的解药不是个人减碳-是找到同伴一起行动/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/cb2f3d103db50796-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"N\"><span class=\"dur\">30:06</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">Nature Podcast</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1123</span></div>\n<h2>氣候焦慮的解藥不是個人減碳，是找到同伴一起行動</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">頂尖氣候科學家說，個人少用塑料袋沒用；真正有效的是用投票和集體行動改變系統，而焦慮本身可以是推動行動的燃料。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">氣候變化</span><span class=\"tag\">心理健康</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"Frederick Law Olmsted, Part 1 Greensward Plan Free Soil Movement Seneca Village\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-11-23-stuffmissed-设计中央公园的人曾自掏腰包给堪萨斯自由州民兵买过一门炮/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/88586eb98e196b1a-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"S\"><span class=\"dur\">40:45</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">Stuff You Missed in History Class</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1123</span></div>\n<h2>設計中央公園的人曾自掏腰包給堪薩斯自由州民兵買過一門炮</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">在成為景觀建築師之前，Olmsted 當過農民、記者和軍火籌款人——他為《紐約時報》寫南方見聞時親眼改變了對奴隸制的看法，又為堪薩斯的反奴隸制民兵買了一門榴彈炮。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">歷史人物</span><span class=\"tag\">城市公園</span>\n</div></div></a>"]